{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0144_1003_p", "source_sha256": "df33d935b3ff76016cf9de2b7eaf6471a381b77c205f010f17540124ab9987f4", "ja": "もし怖いなら、普通のサイズに変えてもらえないか\n相談してみるけど。どうする？", "zh": "要是害怕的话，我可以去商量一下\n看能不能换成普通尺寸。你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0144_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "43b026f757f9a71b438f3c55f89bf3642ab57859b4a06a5b960f53bd511267c5", "ja": "ん……平気、です。\nちょっと、怖いけど……でも……。", "zh": "嗯……没、事的。\n虽然有点，害怕……不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0144_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "948cbe4c79c1d1a43cfdd555eeff8853a66bc040d030411d7d09d8540b72b268", "ja": "武器みたいで、ドキドキする……♪", "zh": "像武器一样，让人心跳加速……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0144_1006_p", "source_sha256": "1fb4e1f9c28698d672122b863fce9179126bd8e06dc623774493bfe4aa0fa521", "ja": "はは、なるほどな。それじゃあ、もし百合子が\n怖がったら、杏奈がリードしてやってくれ。", "zh": "哈哈，原来如此。那要是百合子害怕了，就由杏奈来带领她吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0144_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "01007261be1913d913551eebb47173f675227d84de191b11a4992dabb5ca7b48", "ja": "はい……♪\nでも、百合子さんもきっと、大丈夫……。", "zh": "是……♪\n不过，百合子也一定没事的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0144_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "5bfb68bfd985d905d95fe5a1c0e86ca810d6d158051209faf3e4391db302abd9", "ja": "今日の、パーティーのPV……\n百合子さん、すごく楽しみに……してた、から。", "zh": "今天的派对PV……\n百合子姐一直……非常期待的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0144_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "65d80b8c6ccc731d9580f1b11d8c2a27444ab322e292c0e4e1f29fed8881fc22", "ja": "見てくれた人、みんな……\nパーティーに招待しちゃおうね、って……♪", "zh": "把看过的人，大家……\n都邀请到派对来，这样说过……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0144_1010_p", "source_sha256": "42822a77091e5554a3a28e7b9ed2e004ed06754a17073963518daa0c986377c4", "ja": "……そうか、仕事のこともふたりで、\n相談してくれてるんだな。えらいぞ！", "zh": "……这样啊，工作上的事你们两个\n也商量过了呢。真了不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0144_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "ef5855fb57d9c460c3cb43c2a41f1b9a9f91d96dadd424d79939354cb770b799", "ja": "えへへ……♪", "zh": "嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0144_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1ac4c9d12f925fbe5473c5b2765000ad56f848cf37ae74ce3a3f1143d2e91fc5", "ja": "じゃあ、撮影本番はふたりに任せて大丈夫かな。\n百合子とふたりで、しっかり頼むぞ。", "zh": "那么，正式拍摄就交给你们两个，没问题吧。\n和百合子一起，好好拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0144_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0144_1014_p", "source_sha256": "22c906579856f1082b8abca8a7184a2e4964784b824f639686fb8824a5d7e411", "ja": "ん？　どうした？\n他にもなにかあるのか？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了？\n还有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0144_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "9942a45fecf65d63e432f4d09f54fd3d95fb2f24bc5ba851b55ae25a59502b2c", "ja": "{$P$}さん、本番のとき……。\nカメラの近くに、いて……ほしい、です。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，正式开拍的时候……\n希望你能……待在……摄影机附近。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0144_1016_p", "source_sha256": "a9a2b8dcbee515761ab91bcd8f7381debdb6f15e863409640ee85ef55d0d0129", "ja": "カメラの近くに？\n別にいいけど……、どうしてまた？", "zh": "要待在摄像机附近？\n倒也没问题……不过，为什么又要这样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0144_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "4ad03718a3a4ac31d6f2b9b78440be9a5e96e7c99aa5812b5cdf39574f05dabf", "ja": "百合子さん、言ってたの。\nパーティーに、いちばん招待したいのは……。", "zh": "百合子说过的。\n她最想邀请来参加派对的人是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0144_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "51be19359393c5b39746c461af9c69cc4a74afc291327da24e89feb68feb4e14", "ja": "{$P$}さんだね、って……。\n……杏奈も、おんなじ……です♪", "zh": "是{$P$}先生呢……\n……杏奈也，一样……想邀请您♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
